  tag: 0
  title: "Chim L\u1EA1c"
  body: "Khi m\xF4 t\u1EA3 c\xE1c v\xE0nh hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng Ng\u1ECDc L\u0169,
    B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng L\u1ECBch s\u1EED Qu\u1ED1c gia d\xF9ng t\xEAn chim L\u1EA1c
    cho m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 h\xECnh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng chim. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 t\xEAn c\u1EE7a
    h\xECnh t\u01B0\u1EE3ng trang tr\xED, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i b\u1EB1ng ch\u1EE9ng
    x\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh m\u1ED9t lo\xE0i chim hi\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EA1i. Linh Th\u1EA7n
    Chim L\u1EA1c c\u1EE7a game l\xE0 h\u01B0 c\u1EA5u."
  sourceRef: "https://baotanglichsu.vn/VI/Articles/1001/19707/bao-vat-quoc-gia-viet-nam-trong-djong-ngoc-lu.html
    | \u0111\u1ED1i chi\u1EBFu 05/11/2026"
  verified: 1
